{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S02、S04、S11、S13的感受提示较密，部分意象和心理补充略显用力，容易让观众短暂分神；但按音乐节点逐步出现后，整体负担仍可接受。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y通过关键心理词加亮，让观众即使不逐字读完，也能迅速抓住每段发生了什么、人物为什么这样反应。感受词按照音乐节点出现，加上水波、船身、光线、声部变化等具体线索，使情绪不只是抽象的喜怒哀乐，而有了身体感和音乐中的细微变化。X的叙述同样完整，但左右两栏并行、感受词偏并列罗列，心理发展的连续性和音乐细节的对应关系不如Y容易被普通观众即时捕捉。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1aa19994-32fa-4335-8044-3f2c61775ccf", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T011251004035Z", "elapsed_seconds": 53.015, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:13:44.053600+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "de74279a65f49de1f0ee28ebd17ae882a53da4a2fb3d5b797144445d3368e9f7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_we